reference.api:
```
GET  /v1/lockers?near=&size=M          → lockers with free capacity for size
POST /v1/bookings   {order_id, locker_id, size}   + Idempotency-Key → {booking_id, hold_until}
POST /v1/lockers/{id}/dropoff   {parcel_barcode}   (courier)  → {door, open_cmd_id}
POST /v1/lockers/{id}/pickup    {code}             (customer) → {door, open_cmd_id}
Device → cloud: POST /v1/devices/{id}/events [{seq, type, door, ts}]
Cloud → device: command {cmd_id, open_door, door}  (ack required)
```
